        "official_en_sha256": "74bf474613a7e30346db2df7218d457944b7b5653b6106d02857ccfb312a4511"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あなた方は殺しはしませんよ。\r\n生きて私の実験材料になってもらいます。",
        "official_en": "Don’t worry, I won’t kill any of you. You’ll be much more useful alive, as my lab rats.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
