      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "くくくっ！\r\n爽やかな朝に聞きたいような兄妹喧嘩ですねぇ。\r\nですが、そこまで。",
        "official_en": "Heh heh heh! Ahh...nothing like a quaint little family squabble...like the chittering, skittering of songbirds on a bright and brisk morning. But enough of that.",
        "real_en": "Heh heh heh! What a lovely little sibling quarrel for a refreshing morning. But that's enough."
      },
      "review": {
